// Covenant Example: Time-Locked Withdrawal
//
// This contract enforces that the spending transaction must have a
// locktime >= 1000 (block height). The preimage is verified via
// OP_PUSH_TX, then the locktime field is extracted and checked.
//
// Initial stack (bottom to top):
//   <preimage>
//   <k=1 signature>
//
// In simulated mode, set initial stack to:
//    0xdeadbeef
//   (This is a fake preimage with locktime = 1000 at the correct offset)

// Verify the preimage is authentic
// (In simulated mode, checkSigVerify auto-succeeds)
checkPreimage

// Extract locktime from the verified preimage
dup
extractLocktime

// Check that locktime >= 1000 (block height ~1000)
1000 greaterThanOrEqual
verify

// Extract the amount to ensure minimum value
extractAmount

// Ensure at least 10000 satoshis locked
10000 greaterThanOrEqual
verify

// Contract passes
true
